  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Information Sharing, Coordination, Common Positioning and Collective Advocacy among INGO Forum members in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will complement and enhance existing INGO initiatives and enable the Forum to address additional needs identified by our members in order to enhance their ability to effectively and efficiently respond to the humanitarian and development needs in the rapidly changing operational context in Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
